# NOTE: model.pkl, model_meta.json, feature_stats.json and raw_market_data.csv
# ARE committed on purpose — the deployed app loads them at startup and there is
# no build step that regenerates them (that needs internet + ~30s of training).
# Re-run `python fetch_data.py && python train.py` and commit when you want to
# refresh the data / model.
